  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">External support for leaning and consolidating procedures and organisational set-up for implementation of strategic sector cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Given the scope and complexity of the tasks facing the newly established Secretariat, the consultancy will underpin the Secretariat&#x2019;s capacity as well as ensure continuity in the performance of its tasks during its start-up phase, and bring learnings into the revision of the guidelines.

The consultancy will provide external assistance and professional advice in connection with the implementation of the above-mentioned four priority work streams. 
The work will take place in close dialogue with the Secretariat.</narrative>
